cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SHERPA, please cite it as below."
title: "SHERPA: Shrinkage-based Heavy Equipment Residual Price Analysis"
abstract: >-
  An explainable model of used heavy-equipment sale prices and rental rates,
  fitted jointly from marketplace listings with one shared machine-value core,
  hierarchical partial pooling, robust estimation and conformal prediction
  intervals.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "EquipmentsFinder"
    website: "https://www.equipmentsfinder.com"
version: 0.1.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/dev-kakosoai/sherpa-valuation"
url: "https://www.equipmentsfinder.com"
keywords:
  - heavy equipment
  - residual value
  - rental rates
  - hedonic pricing
  - empirical Bayes
  - conformal prediction
